STAL 0x10
GotoPrepScreen

//Label EndingScene
EndingScene:
FADI 0x5
CLEE 0x0
MUSC Victory_March
SetBackground(0x07) // The harbor, as Cesarian ships arrive.
Text(Mage6LeaveRefugeMurielEndingText)
MoveToChapter(MageLeaveRefugeMuriel7)
NoFade
ENDA

